    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild constipation; no vomiting in four weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Dry mouth</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No palpitations, chest pain, or fainting</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Grogginess in the first hour of the morning; no dizziness on standing</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; less worried about going out; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

